sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Pengajar/Mahasiswa
    participant W as E-Learning FE
    participant A as E-Learning API
    participant F as File Service
    participant S as Object Storage

    P->>W: Pilih file
    W->>A: Request upload session + context
    A->>F: Authorize context dan create file object
    F-->>A: fileObjectId + signed upload URL
    A-->>W: signed upload URL
    W->>F: Upload binary
    F->>S: Simpan dan scan binary
    F-->>W: Scan status / completion
    W->>A: Simpan FileRef pada item
    P->>W: Buka file
    W->>A: Request access
    A->>F: Re-authorize user dan context
    F-->>W: signed download URL
    W->>F: Download/stream
